# .claude-context — nutrition-labels repo map (token-optimized)

## Stack
- **Frontend**: React 18 + TS, Vite, Zustand, React Query, Tailwind, @react-pdf/renderer (client-side PDF)
- **Backend**: FastAPI + SQLite (read-only, FTS5), slowapi. NO PDF code.
- **Infra**: docker-compose — db-init → backend(:8000) + frontend(nginx) behind Caddy TLS

