### Stores (Zustand)
- **`recipeStore`** — active recipe; NOT persisted. All ingredient actions key off `instanceId`.
  Holds label-meta overrides (`servingHousehold`, `addedSugarsG`, `transFatG`).
  Actions: add/remove/updateName/updateAmount/updateUnit (preserves grams) /
  updatePortion (preserves grams)/moveIngredient; setPortionDivisor/setLabelName/setDimensions/
  setHighlightedNutrients/setServingHousehold/setAddedSugarsG/setTransFatG;
  step add/update/remove/move; variable add/set/update/remove;
  clearRecipe/loadRecipe/loadVersion/exitVersionView/setCurrentRecipeId.
  Internal `withInstanceIds` back-fills legacy persisted rows.
- **`savedRecipesStore`** — `nl_saved_recipes` v2; max 50 recipes × 20 versions.
  `RecipeSnapshot` includes label-meta overrides.
  `createRecipe(snapshot, note?)→id`, `appendVersion(id, snapshot, note?)`,
  `renameRecipe(id, name)`, `deleteRecipe(id)`, `deleteVersion(id, versionId)`.
  v1→v2 migration wraps legacy flat snapshots as a single version.
- **`preferencesStore`** — `nl_preferences`; `recents` (max 15) + `favorites` + `isMethodExpanded`.
- **`themeStore`** — `nl-theme`; ThemeKey: `"paper"|"overcast"|"twilight"|"midnight"`;
  per-theme accent map; `useActiveTheme()`, `themeVars(def, accentHex)` → CSS custom props.

### Hooks (frontend/src/hooks)
- `useNutritionCalc()` — memoized live `MacroProfile` (unrounded; reacts to ingredients + portionDivisor)
- `useIngredientSearch(query)` — React Query, 300ms debounce, staleTime 30s, enabled ≥2 chars
- `useDebounce<T>(value, ms)`
- `useLabelResize()` — pointer-drag; INCHES_PER_PX=1/96; clamps width 2–8in, height 2–12in;
  exposes `onPointerDownCorner/East/South`
- `useLabelSave()` — snapshot construction, save-vs-save-as-new, "X min ago" formatting,
  transient SAVED ✓ feedback
- `useAnimatedNumber(target, opts?)` — rAF, default 420ms cubic ease-out
- `useRecipeActions()` — bundled recipeStore actions via `useShallow` (stable refs)
- `usePageMeta({ title, description, canonical })` — title + meta/link tags
- `useAdSenseBootstrap()` — script injection, no-op when disabled
- `useTitleAutoResize()` — fits Title text to its container
